assert find_first_minimum_index([5, 5, 5, 3, 3]) == 3
assert find_first_minimum_index([9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1]) == 8

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
- Module: `Solution`
- Function: `find_first_minimum_index`

